  "instructions": [
    "In a large bowl, combine danmuji, cucumber, carrots, and green onions.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together Gochujang, soy sauce, rice vinegar, honey, and garlic.",
    "Pour the dressing over the danmuji mixture and toss to combine.",
    "Sprinkle toasted sesame seeds over the top of the salad.",
    "Chill in the refrigerator for at least 30 minutes to allow the flavors to meld.",
    "Just before serving, give the salad a good stir and adjust the seasoning if needed.",
    "Serve the salad cold, garnished with additional green onions and sesame seeds if desired."
